# {{.ProjectName}}

A modern, high-performance fullstack web application built with **Go Fiber**, **HTML Templates**, **HTMX 2.0**, and **Tailwind CSS**.

---

## ⚡ Tech Stack

- **Backend:** [Go](https://go.dev) + [Fiber v2](https://gofiber.io)
- **Templating:** Fiber HTML template engine (`html/template`)
- **Interactivity:** [HTMX 2.0](https://htmx.org) for zero-JS dynamic updates
- **Styling:** [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com) via Play CDN
- **Containerization:** Docker & Docker Compose

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. Prerequisites
- Go 1.22+ installed
- (Optional) Docker for containerized deployment

### 2. Run Locally
```bash
# Install dependencies
go mod tidy

# Run application
go run cmd/web/main.go
# Or via Makefile:
make run
```

Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) in your browser.

---

## 🐳 Docker

```bash
# Start container
docker-compose up --build -d

# Stop container
docker-compose down
```

---

